==================== Branch work267, patch #1 ====================

Add -mdebug=extra1 through -mdebug=extra5

We've had various -mdebug=<xxx> options for some time.  This patch adds several
debug options that developers can use without adding their own debug options.

2026-10-21  Michael Meissner  <meissner@linux.ibm.com>

	* common/config/rs6000/rs6000rcommon.cc (rs6000_handle_option): Add
	support for -mdebug=estra{1,2,3,4,5}.
	* config/rs6000/rs6000.h (MASK_DEBUG_*): Likewise.
	(TARGET_DEBUG_*): Likewise.

